[[{"s":26,"a":70,"en":"When he said to his father and his people, \"What do you worship?\"","w":[["إِذۡ","When"],["قَالَ","he said"],["لِأَبِيهِ","to his father"],["وَقَوۡمِهِۦ","and his people"],["مَا","What"],["تَعۡبُدُونَ","(do) you worship"]]},{"s":26,"a":152,"en":"Who cause corruption in the land and do not amend.\"","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["يُفۡسِدُونَ","spread corruption"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","the earth"],["وَلَا","and (do) not"],["يُصۡلِحُونَ","reform"]]},{"s":21,"a":106,"en":"Indeed, in this [Qur'an] is notification for a worshipping people.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["فِي","in"],["هَٰذَا","this"],["لَبَلَٰغٗا","surely is a Message"],["لِّقَوۡمٍ","for a people"],["عَٰبِدِينَ","worshippers"]]},{"s":89,"a":5,"en":"Is there [not] in [all] that an oath [sufficient] for one of perception?","w":[["هَلۡ","Is"],["فِي","in"],["ذَٰلِكَ","that"],["قَسَمٞ","(not) an oath"],["لِّذِي","for those"],["حِجۡرٍ","who understand"]]}],[{"s":23,"a":31,"en":"Then We produced after them a generation of others.","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["أَنشَأۡنَا","We produced"],["مِنۢ","after them"],["بَعۡدِهِمۡ","after them"],["قَرۡنًا","a generation"],["ءَاخَرِينَ","another"]]},{"s":28,"a":65,"en":"And [mention] the Day He will call them and say, \"What did you answer the messengers?\"","w":[["وَيَوۡمَ","And (the) Day"],["يُنَادِيهِمۡ","He will call them"],["فَيَقُولُ","and say"],["مَاذَآ","What"],["أَجَبۡتُمُ","did you answer"],["ٱلۡمُرۡسَلِينَ","the Messengers"]]},{"s":15,"a":82,"en":"And they used to carve from the mountains, houses, feeling secure.","w":[["وَكَانُواْ","And they used (to)"],["يَنۡحِتُونَ","carve"],["مِنَ","from"],["ٱلۡجِبَالِ","the mountains"],["بُيُوتًا","houses"],["ءَامِنِينَ","secure"]]},{"s":3,"a":63,"en":"But if they turn away, then indeed - Allah is Knowing of the corrupters.","w":[["فَإِن","And if"],["تَوَلَّوۡاْ","they turn back"],["فَإِنَّ","then indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["عَلِيمُۢ","(is) All-Knowing"],["بِٱلۡمُفۡسِدِينَ","of the corrupters"]]}],[{"s":73,"a":16,"en":"But Pharaoh disobeyed the messenger, so We seized him with a ruinous seizure.","w":[["فَعَصَىٰ","But disobeyed"],["فِرۡعَوۡنُ","Firaun"],["ٱلرَّسُولَ","the Messenger"],["فَأَخَذۡنَٰهُ","so We seized him"],["أَخۡذٗا","(with) a seizure"],["وَبِيلٗا","ruinous"]]},{"s":20,"a":68,"en":"Allah said, \"Fear not. Indeed, it is you who are superior.","w":[["قُلۡنَا","We said"],["لَا","(Do) not"],["تَخَفۡ","fear"],["إِنَّكَ","Indeed,you"],["أَنتَ","you"],["ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","(will be) superior"]]},{"s":15,"a":71,"en":"[Lot] said, \"These are my daughters - if you would be doers [of lawful marriage].\"","w":[["قَالَ","He said"],["هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","These"],["بَنَاتِيٓ","(are) my daughters"],["إِن","if"],["كُنتُمۡ","you would be"],["فَٰعِلِينَ","doers"]]},{"s":26,"a":135,"en":"Indeed, I fear for you the punishment of a terrible day.\"","w":[["إِنِّيٓ","Indeed,I"],["أَخَافُ","[I] fear"],["عَلَيۡكُمۡ","for you"],["عَذَابَ","(the) punishment"],["يَوۡمٍ","(of) a Day"],["عَظِيمٖ","Great"]]}],[{"s":99,"a":8,"en":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it.","w":[["وَمَن","And whoever"],["يَعۡمَلۡ","does"],["مِثۡقَالَ","(equal to the) weight"],["ذَرَّةٖ","(of) an atom"],["شَرّٗا","evil"],["يَرَهُۥ","will see it"]]},{"s":3,"a":46,"en":"He will speak to the people in the cradle and in maturity and will be of the righteous.\"","w":[["وَيُكَلِّمُ","And he will speak"],["ٱلنَّاسَ","(to) the people"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡمَهۡدِ","the cradle"],["وَكَهۡلٗا","and (in) maturity"],["وَمِنَ","and (he will be) of"],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","the righteous"]]},{"s":18,"a":23,"en":"And never say of anything, \"Indeed, I will do that tomorrow,\"","w":[["وَلَا","And (do) not"],["تَقُولَنَّ","say"],["لِشَاْيۡءٍ","of anything"],["إِنِّي","Indeed,I"],["فَاعِلٞ","will do"],["ذَٰلِكَ","that"],["غَدًا","tomorrow"]]},{"s":31,"a":24,"en":"We grant them enjoyment for a little; then We will force them to a massive punishment.","w":[["نُمَتِّعُهُمۡ","We grant them enjoyment"],["قَلِيلٗا","(for) a little"],["ثُمَّ","then"],["نَضۡطَرُّهُمۡ","We will force them"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["عَذَابٍ","a punishment"],["غَلِيظٖ","severe"]]}],[{"s":21,"a":16,"en":"And We did not create the heaven and earth and that between them in play.","w":[["وَمَا","And not"],["خَلَقۡنَا","We created"],["ٱلسَّمَآءَ","the heavens"],["وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ","and the earth"],["وَمَا","and what"],["بَيۡنَهُمَا","(is) between them"],["لَٰعِبِينَ","(for) playing"]]},{"s":22,"a":68,"en":"And if they dispute with you, then say, \"Allah is most knowing of what you do.","w":[["وَإِن","And if"],["جَٰدَلُوكَ","they argue (with) you"],["فَقُلِ","then say"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["أَعۡلَمُ","(is) most knowing"],["بِمَا","of what"],["تَعۡمَلُونَ","you do"]]},{"s":12,"a":7,"en":"Certainly were there in Joseph and his brothers signs for those who ask,","w":[["۞لَّقَدۡ","Certainly"],["كَانَ","were"],["فِي","in"],["يُوسُفَ","Yusuf"],["وَإِخۡوَتِهِۦٓ","and his brothers"],["ءَايَٰتٞ","signs"],["لِّلسَّآئِلِينَ","for those who ask"]]},{"s":42,"a":34,"en":"Or He could destroy them for what they earned; but He pardons much.","w":[["أَوۡ","Or"],["يُوبِقۡهُنَّ","He could destroy them"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَسَبُواْ","they have earned"],["وَيَعۡفُ","but He pardons"],["عَن","[from]"],["كَثِيرٖ","much"]]}],[{"s":6,"a":105,"en":"And thus do We diversify the verses so the disbelievers will say, \"You have studied,\" and so We may make the Qur'an clear for a people who know.","w":[["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","And thus"],["نُصَرِّفُ","We explain"],["ٱلۡأٓيَٰتِ","the Signs"],["وَلِيَقُولُواْ","that they (may) say"],["دَرَسۡتَ","You have studied"],["وَلِنُبَيِّنَهُۥ","and that We (may) make it clear"],["لِقَوۡمٖ","for a people"],["يَعۡلَمُونَ","who know"]]},{"s":23,"a":64,"en":"Until when We seize their affluent ones with punishment, at once they are crying [to Allah] for help.","w":[["حَتَّىٰٓ","Until"],["إِذَآ","when"],["أَخَذۡنَا","We seize"],["مُتۡرَفِيهِم","their affluent ones"],["بِٱلۡعَذَابِ","with the punishment"],["إِذَا","behold"],["هُمۡ","They"],["يَجۡـَٔرُونَ","cry for help"]]},{"s":38,"a":12,"en":"The people of Noah denied before them, and [the tribe of] 'Aad and Pharaoh, the owner of stakes,","w":[["كَذَّبَتۡ","Denied"],["قَبۡلَهُمۡ","before them"],["قَوۡمُ","(the) people"],["نُوحٖ","(of) Nuh"],["وَعَادٞ","and Aad"],["وَفِرۡعَوۡنُ","and Firaun"],["ذُو","(the) owner"],["ٱلۡأَوۡتَادِ","(of) the stakes"]]},{"s":67,"a":24,"en":"Say, \"It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.\"","w":[["قُلۡ","Say"],["هُوَ","He"],["ٱلَّذِي","(is) the One Who"],["ذَرَأَكُمۡ","multiplied you"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضِ","the earth"],["وَإِلَيۡهِ","and to Him"],["تُحۡشَرُونَ","you will be gathered"]]}],[{"s":68,"a":42,"en":"The Day the shin will be uncovered and they are invited to prostration but the disbelievers will not be able,","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(The) Day"],["يُكۡشَفُ","will be uncovered"],["عَن","from"],["سَاقٖ","the shin"],["وَيُدۡعَوۡنَ","and they will be called"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلسُّجُودِ","prostrate"],["فَلَا","but not"],["يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ","they will be able"]]},{"s":62,"a":7,"en":"But they will not wish for it, ever, because of what their hands have put forth. And Allah is Knowing of the wrongdoers.","w":[["وَلَا","But not"],["يَتَمَنَّوۡنَهُۥٓ","they will wish for it"],["أَبَدَۢا","ever"],["بِمَا","for what"],["قَدَّمَتۡ","(have) sent forth"],["أَيۡدِيهِمۡۚ","their hands"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah"],["عَلِيمُۢ","(is) All-Knowing"],["بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","of the wrongdoers"]]},{"s":11,"a":99,"en":"And they were followed in this [world] with a curse and on the Day of Resurrection. And wretched is the gift which is given.","w":[["وَأُتۡبِعُواْ","And they were followed"],["فِي","in"],["هَٰذِهِۦ","this"],["لَعۡنَةٗ","(by) a curse"],["وَيَوۡمَ","and (on the) Day"],["ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِۚ","(of) the Resurrection"],["بِئۡسَ","Wretched"],["ٱلرِّفۡدُ","(is) the gift"],["ٱلۡمَرۡفُودُ","which (will) be given"]]},{"s":19,"a":90,"en":"The heavens almost rupture therefrom and the earth splits open and the mountains collapse in devastation","w":[["تَكَادُ","Almost"],["ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتُ","the heavens"],["يَتَفَطَّرۡنَ","get torn"],["مِنۡهُ","therefrom"],["وَتَنشَقُّ","and splits asunder"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","the earth"],["وَتَخِرُّ","and collapse"],["ٱلۡجِبَالُ","the mountain"],["هَدًّا","(in) devastation"]]}],[{"s":22,"a":16,"en":"And thus have We sent the Qur'an down as verses of clear evidence and because Allah guides whom He intends.","w":[["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","And thus"],["أَنزَلۡنَٰهُ","We sent it down"],["ءَايَٰتِۭ","(as) clear Verses"],["بَيِّنَٰتٖ","(as) clear Verses"],["وَأَنَّ","and that"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["يَهۡدِي","guides"],["مَن","whom"],["يُرِيدُ","He intends"]]},{"s":41,"a":23,"en":"And that was your assumption which you assumed about your Lord. It has brought you to ruin, and you have become among the losers.\"","w":[["وَذَٰلِكُمۡ","And that"],["ظَنُّكُمُ","(was) your assumption"],["ٱلَّذِي","which"],["ظَنَنتُم","you assumed"],["بِرَبِّكُمۡ","about your Lord"],["أَرۡدَىٰكُمۡ","It has ruined you"],["فَأَصۡبَحۡتُم","and you have become"],["مِّنَ","of"],["ٱلۡخَٰسِرِينَ","the losers"]]},{"s":8,"a":51,"en":"That is for what your hands have put forth [of evil] and because Allah is not ever unjust to His servants.\"","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That"],["بِمَا","(is) for what"],["قَدَّمَتۡ","sent forth"],["أَيۡدِيكُمۡ","your hands"],["وَأَنَّ","And indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["لَيۡسَ","(is) not"],["بِظَلَّـٰمٖ","unjust"],["لِّلۡعَبِيدِ","to His slaves"]]},{"s":51,"a":16,"en":"Accepting what their Lord has given them. Indeed, they were before that doers of good.","w":[["ءَاخِذِينَ","Taking"],["مَآ","what"],["ءَاتَىٰهُمۡ","their Lord has given them"],["رَبُّهُمۡۚ","their Lord has given them"],["إِنَّهُمۡ","Indeed,they"],["كَانُواْ","were"],["قَبۡلَ","before"],["ذَٰلِكَ","that"],["مُحۡسِنِينَ","good-doers"]]}]]